{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>由 Prodigy Design 開發的 Rival Stars Horse Racing 現於 Epic Games 限時免費，香港時間 9 月 3 日 23:00 前可免費領取。遊戲以寫實馬匹、深度育種系統和豐富競賽模式為賣點，為賽馬愛好者帶來馳騁賽場的沉浸體驗。</p>\n<p>玩家可培育專屬馬匹，透過配種改良血統，並在多元賽事中磨練騎術與戰略。遊戲從策騎、訓練到比賽皆融入細緻玩法，讓玩家逐步邁向馬術傳奇之路。</p>\n\n<img alt=\"【PC】模擬賽馬育成競技遊戲 Rival Stars Horse Racing 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rival-Stars-Horse-Racing-1njwd.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【PC】模擬賽馬育成競技遊戲 Rival Stars Horse Racing 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rival-Stars-Horse-Racing-Rmjfy.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【PC】模擬賽馬育成競技遊戲 Rival Stars Horse Racing 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rival-Stars-Horse-Racing-C7vbe.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【PC】模擬賽馬育成競技遊戲 Rival Stars Horse Racing 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rival-Stars-Horse-Racing-16qpj.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【PC】模擬賽馬育成競技遊戲 Rival Stars Horse Racing 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rival-Stars-Horse-Racing-1t3c4.jpg\"/>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Rival Stars Horse Racing<br/>支援平台：Windows/macOS<br/>領取位置：Epic Games</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T00:40:07.691774+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}